        "date_added": "2026-11-08 17:27:31",
        "twitter_handle": null,
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Submitter note: the MopsStealer tag on this sample was set but only assessed and not confirmed at the time. Basis for the assignation: the C2 mopsikimilie.cc is tagged MopsStealer on ThreatFox (source: abuse.ch), and this sample creates the mutex Global\\RuntimeBrokerAds, also seen in sandbox runs of 1c850a5b and 3c110de7, two DLLs self-identifying as \"Mops Stealer V3\". The static comparison found no shared code, only the mutex name matches. Other detections naming it MopsStealer may echo this tag which hopefully is not wrong."
      }
